      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Welcome ​<user-mention data-id=\"108868\">@martona</user-mention>, to the community!</p><p>The list of devices supported by <a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/embedded-software/STSW-eDSim.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">eDSim</a> is included in <a href=\"https://www.st.com/resource/en/data_brief/stsw-edsim.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">DB4424</a>. The current version 14 of eDSim can handle some VIPER0x, VIPER1x, VIPER2x and VIPER3x devices, but VIPER06XSTR, to my great regret, is not yet among them. Unfortunately, I have no information on whether or when this will be implemented.</p><p>Regards<br/>/Peter</p></div>"
